{"unit_id":"Rain-kl__dsh-preset-plus#card-zh","repo":"Rain-kl/dsh-preset-plus","commit":"90674c90ec91a8c60a52d29e92c5218c0edad8e9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-Preset-Plus 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的提示词预设编辑插件。它在设置页提供多预设管理，可编辑 system、user、assistant 条目，并将预设保存到本地文件。插件通过固定的 preset-plus 模式注入当前激活预设，支持首条消息自动注入或使用命令手动预填，还能导入、导出单个预设或整套预设。适合需要维护多套提示词、调整注入内容并在会话中切换的 DSH 用户；无需额外账号或 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:30-52","lib/index.js:74-81","lib/index.js:99-146","lib/index.js:271-289"]}
{"unit_id":"Rain-kl__dsh-preset-plus#card-en","repo":"Rain-kl/dsh-preset-plus","commit":"90674c90ec91a8c60a52d29e92c5218c0edad8e9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH-Preset-Plus is a DSH web prompt editor. Users manage multiple locally saved presets with system, user, and assistant entries. In preset-plus mode, the active preset is injected automatically or by manual prefill. Import or export one preset or the full set. No account or API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:30-52","lib/index.js:74-81","lib/index.js:99-146","lib/index.js:271-289"]}
