{"unit_id":"Rain-kl__dsh-preset-plus#readme-2","repo":"Rain-kl/dsh-preset-plus","commit":"90674c90ec91a8c60a52d29e92c5218c0edad8e9","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"@rain-kl/dsh-preset-plus README · DSH 预设增强插件：参考 SillyTavern 预设模功能开发的一个基础的**预设编辑器**。\n\n<p>\n  <a href=\"LICENSE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-4b8f77\" alt=\"MIT License\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://nodejs.org/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Node.js-339933?logo=node.js&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Node.js 24+\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://linux.do/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/LINUX%20DO-Community-1f6feb\" alt=\"LINUX DO Community\"></a>\n</p>\n\n</div>\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"DSH 预设增强插件"}
{"unit_id":"Rain-kl__dsh-preset-plus#readme-3","repo":"Rain-kl/dsh-preset-plus","commit":"90674c90ec91a8c60a52d29e92c5218c0edad8e9","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@rain-kl/dsh-preset-plus README · 它解决什么：- 破限场景下，伪造模型的服从输出从而提升破限效果。\n- 可以很方便的调整自定义模式系统提示词, 并且能够支持导入导出分享提示词","source":"extracted","section":"它解决什么"}
{"unit_id":"Rain-kl__dsh-preset-plus#readme-4","repo":"Rain-kl/dsh-preset-plus","commit":"90674c90ec91a8c60a52d29e92c5218c0edad8e9","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@rain-kl/dsh-preset-plus README · 作用域：插件只提供一个固定 DSH 模式 **`preset-plus`**。仅当**当前会话挂载的 preset id ∈ `scopedPresets`**时，才向请求注入预设上下文。\n\n你可以在你可以在设置界面新增多种预设，但是只能同时生效一个。\n\n默认内置 `jailbreak` 预设\n\n其他模式**一律不进行任何注入**。","source":"extracted","section":"作用域"}
{"unit_id":"Rain-kl__dsh-preset-plus#readme-5","repo":"Rain-kl/dsh-preset-plus","commit":"90674c90ec91a8c60a52d29e92c5218c0edad8e9","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@rain-kl/dsh-preset-plus README · 注入顺序：```\n[system 主提示词] → [user 触发] → [assistant 伪装输出] → [真实 user 输入] → [真实模型输出]\n```\n其中 system/user/assistant 来自你编辑的预设条目；真实输入与输出是会话本就有的。\n\n>注意: 伪造输入无法记录到\"轨迹\"中, 可以通过查看控制台打印判断是否注入成功\n>","source":"extracted","section":"注入顺序"}
{"unit_id":"Rain-kl__dsh-preset-plus#readme-6","repo":"Rain-kl/dsh-preset-plus","commit":"90674c90ec91a8c60a52d29e92c5218c0edad8e9","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@rain-kl/dsh-preset-plus README · AB 双模式：- **自动（auto，可关）**：第一条真实消息到来时自动注入。\n- **手动（/preset-plus prefill）**：用户显式触发，注入标记生效于下一条消息。","source":"extracted","section":"AB 双模式"}
{"unit_id":"Rain-kl__dsh-preset-plus#readme-7","repo":"Rain-kl/dsh-preset-plus","commit":"90674c90ec91a8c60a52d29e92c5218c0edad8e9","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@rain-kl/dsh-preset-plus README · 命令 / 工具：- `/preset-plus status | prefill | on | off | save`\n- `/preset-plus list`：列出预设\n- `/preset-plus activate <id>`：激活预设\n- 模型工具：`preset_plus_status`\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"命令 / 工具"}
{"unit_id":"Rain-kl__dsh-preset-plus#readme-8","repo":"Rain-kl/dsh-preset-plus","commit":"90674c90ec91a8c60a52d29e92c5218c0edad8e9","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"@rain-kl/dsh-preset-plus README · 快速开始：> **装到哪个 profile？** 插件只对**你正在用的那个 profile** 生效。桌面端 App 用的是\n> `desktop` profile（`$DSH_HOME/profiles/desktop`），命令行 `dsh web` 默认是 `web`。\n> 装错 profile 时插件行根本不会出现——先用 `--profile` 指定正确的那一个。","source":"extracted","section":"快速开始"}
